{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52864","headline":"破阵乐 · 哥舒翰","name":"破阵乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西戎最沐恩深，犬羊违背生心。\n神将驱兵出塞，横行海畔生擒。\n石堡岩高万丈，雕窠霞外千寻。\n一喝尽属唐国，将知应合天心。\n（见伯三六一九卷。\n转录自任半塘先生《唐声诗》下编第十附录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"哥舒翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}